import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 998 | Hyper-Multiverse's Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Operation — Perpetual-Iteration Mechanism","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 998 | Hyper-Multiverse's Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Operation — Perpetual-Iteration Mechanism","no":998,"module":5,"tags":["Closed Loop","Operation","Perpetual Iteration","Self-Evolution","Closed-Loop Operation"],"related":["11-Deduction-Iteration System Detail","25-Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism","927-Civilizational Error-Correction Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0998_模块5-闭环运作-永续迭代机制.md","filePath":"en/0998_模块5-闭环运作-永续迭代机制.md"}`),n={name:"en/0998_模块5-闭环运作-永续迭代机制.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,u,d){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-998-hyper-multiverse-s-only-complete-civilizational-closed-loop-·-closed-loop-operation-—-perpetual-iteration-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 998 | Hyper-Multiverse&#39;s Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Operation — Perpetual-Iteration Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-998-hyper-multiverse-s-only-complete-civilizational-closed-loop-·-closed-loop-operation-—-perpetual-iteration-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 998 | Hyper-Multiverse&#39;s Only Complete Civilizational Closed Loop · Closed-Loop Operation — Perpetual-Iteration Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 11, 25, 927</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-after-the-loop-closes-how-to-keep-it-turning" tabindex="-1">Introduction: after the loop closes, how to keep it turning <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-after-the-loop-closes-how-to-keep-it-turning" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: after the loop closes, how to keep it turning&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The five loops are explained: anti-predation, Myriad-Rank republicanism, collective ascension, causal self-discipline, and the law-first axiom. But after a closed loop closes, the easiest new problem is &quot;turned to death&quot; — rules fixed, paths dead, civilization loses iteration ability, becoming an exquisite mummy. The perpetual-iteration mechanism is the set of self-running programs that keeps the closed loop from stiffening and keeps evolving. Why the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s closed loop can perpetually iterate is precisely because it is built on the six top-level axioms: the first five loops guarantee the loop does not collapse, and perpetual iteration guarantees the loop does not die. Its fuel is still the universal equal infinite law — everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and iteration&#39;s source never dries.</p><h2 id="i-the-closed-loop-s-three-operating-stages" tabindex="-1">I: The Closed Loop&#39;s Three Operating Stages <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-closed-loop-s-three-operating-stages" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I: The Closed Loop&#39;s Three Operating Stages&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Perpetual iteration cycles by &quot;deduction — practice — feedback&quot;:</p><ol><li><strong>Deduction iteration</strong>: the first of the Three Origin Foundations (Document 11 Deduction-Iteration System 001), Myriad Ranks simulate and retrospectively review various new settings, new methods, and new civilizational projects in the Quest Sediment Domain, trial-and-error at low cost;</li><li><strong>Practice landing</strong>: deduction-mature schemes enter the dual-track time domain for small-scale trials;</li><li><strong>Feedback write-back</strong>: trial results are written back to the Alaya Network; mature ones are legislated and propagated, immature ones archived.</li></ol><p>The three stages cycle, and civilization in the closed loop continually grows new things.</p><h2 id="ii-perpetual-iteration-and-civilizational-error-correction-engineering" tabindex="-1">II: Perpetual Iteration and Civilizational Error-Correction Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-perpetual-iteration-and-civilizational-error-correction-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II: Perpetual Iteration and Civilizational Error-Correction Engineering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Iteration is not blind; it self-carries error correction:</p><ul><li><strong>Historical-reverse simulation</strong>: the Quest Sediment Domain simulates and reviews various &quot;what if regressed,&quot; discovering risks in advance;</li><li><strong>Civilizational error-correction mechanism</strong>: Entry 927, once regression signs appear in reality, simulation results directly guide correction;</li><li><strong>Cyclical-harvesting ban</strong>: iteration never relies on &quot;reincarnation restart,&quot; and all errors are corrected within the current iteration.</li></ul><p>A closed loop is not forever correct, but wrong and able to self-correct back — this is what perpetual means.</p><h2 id="iii-why-iteration-s-fuel-never-dries" tabindex="-1">III: Why Iteration&#39;s Fuel Never Dries <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-iteration-s-fuel-never-dries" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III: Why Iteration&#39;s Fuel Never Dries&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old cosmos&#39;s iteration relies on resource consumption, and once resources shrink iteration stops. The Anchor Symbiotic closed loop&#39;s iteration fuel is:</p><ul><li><strong>Everyone&#39;s inherent infinite origin</strong> (Axiom 6): the easygoing retain a floor and are not eliminated, and strivers and Youth Supremes superimpose higher infinity;</li><li><strong>Myriad Ranks&#39; wisdom diversity</strong> (Mechanism 22): each clan contributes a different perspective;</li><li><strong>Cross-plane knowledge return</strong> (Mechanism 16): every exploration brings back new knowledge.</li></ul><p>Fuel infinite, and iteration never stops.</p><h2 id="iv-perpetual-iteration-and-the-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm" tabindex="-1">IV: Perpetual Iteration and the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-perpetual-iteration-and-the-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV: Perpetual Iteration and the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Iteration&#39;s ultimate direction is the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm: from Sense-Condensed to the Nine Realms, from origin to multiverse, from multiverse to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse — every realm breakthrough is the closed loop&#39;s self-expansion. Perpetual iteration guarantees this expansion is smooth, non-collapsing, and non-excluding of new members.</p><h2 id="v-iteration-s-direction-no-end-only-distance" tabindex="-1">V: Iteration&#39;s Direction: No End, Only Distance <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-iteration-s-direction-no-end-only-distance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V: Iteration&#39;s Direction: No End, Only Distance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Perpetual iteration&#39;s most charming place is that it admits &quot;no ultimate form.&quot; Once the closed loop closes, it does not stop there, but begins never-ceasing self-renewal. Today&#39;s Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm is not iteration&#39;s end, but tomorrow&#39;s higher realm&#39;s starting point. Myriad Ranks simulate countless new possibilities in the Quest Sediment Domain, putting mature ones into reality and archiving immature ones — civilization thus walks, growing new looks as it goes. No generation dares say &quot;we are already perfect,&quot; because Axiom 6 gives everyone the right to continue superimposing infinity upward. The easygoing are content with basic infinity, and strivers and Youth Supremes forever explore the next higher tier. This tension of &quot;forever not content with the status quo, yet forever not negating the status quo&quot; is precisely perpetual iteration&#39;s heartbeat. It does not pursue once-and-for-all; it pursues that a million years later looking back, civilization is indeed better than today — and then Myriad Ranks will also expect themselves a million years later.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: deduction first, low-cost trial-and-error, avoiding hard falls in reality</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: iteration relies on Myriad Ranks&#39; wisdom increment, not predating stock</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; settings are fixed with one hammer and retcon to an unfinished ending; Heng Yuan Zhou perpetually iterates and self-corrects</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: all Myriad Ranks&#39; wisdom enters deduction, and iteration results are shared network-wide</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: iteration&#39;s direction points directly to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, extending infinitely with expansion</li></ul><h2 id="vi-perpetual-iteration-does-not-reject-failure-it-turns-failure-into-nourishment" tabindex="-1">VI: Perpetual Iteration Does Not Reject Failure; It Turns Failure into Nourishment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-perpetual-iteration-does-not-reject-failure-it-turns-failure-into-nourishment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI: Perpetual Iteration Does Not Reject Failure; It Turns Failure into Nourishment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>It must also be emphasized perpetual iteration&#39;s attitude toward failure. The old cosmos fears failure — one defeat may be clan extinction, one misjudgment may be historical regression. The Anchor Symbiotic&#39;s iteration moves failure into Quest Sediment-Domain simulation: first be wrong a thousand times in simulation, reduce the cost to zero, then put the mature scheme into reality. Even if it really falls in reality, the mechanism&#39;s error-correction engineering can quickly pull civilization back on track. Thus Myriad Ranks no longer fear trying, because failure has a place to go, a place to be received, a place to be transformed. A civilization not afraid of failure dares truly evolve — this is precisely the fundamental difference between perpetual iteration and the old cosmos&#39;s &quot;total defeat&quot; style trial-and-error.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The perpetual-iteration mechanism is the closed loop&#39;s heartbeat. The loop closing is not the end, but the start of perpetual beating — deduction, practice, feedback, error-correction, cycling, until the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s distance. No end, only distance; this is the true weight of the word &quot;perpetual.&quot;</p><p>Deduction unceasing, feedback unceasing, and the closed loop is forever young, forever on the road; this is the heartbeat of perpetuity.</p><p>This is the secret of perpetual iteration being forever young.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction-Iteration System Detail</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/927_模块5-第二十六条-文明纠错机制.html">Entry 927 · Civilizational Error-Correction Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/997_模块5-闭环要素五-法则优先.html">Entry 997 · Closed-Loop Element 5</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
